sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant S as /api/billing/subscription
  participant RZ as Razorpay
  participant W as /api/billing/webhook
  participant DB as Postgres

  B->>S: choose a plan
  S->>RZ: create subscription, notes carry the user id
  RZ-->>B: checkout
  B->>RZ: pay
  RZ->>W: subscription.charged, signed
  W->>W: verify HMAC on the raw body, constant time
  W->>DB: insert billing_events row (unique event id)
  alt First delivery
    W->>DB: upsert subscriptions, set plan and period end
  else Seen before and processed
    W-->>RZ: 200 duplicate_ignored
  else Seen before and failed
    W->>DB: reclaim the row, process again
  end
  W-->>RZ: 200, or 500 so Razorpay retries
  Note over B,DB: The plan is granted only by the verified webhook, never by the browser.
